"<h2>Lấy danh sách ứng dụng</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-http\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GET</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /api/v1/apps</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2>Kích hoạt triển khai lại ứng dụng (Redeploy)</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-http\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">POST</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /api/v1/apps/{appId}/redeploy</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2>Lấy danh sách máy chủ</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-http\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GET</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /api/v1/servers</span></span></code></pre>"